# shellcheck shell=bash disable=SC2034
# verify-select.env — the phase tier's selection table (measured-console phase 15).
#
# Two tiers verify this tree. The RELEASE (scripts/gates.sh, no flag) runs every
# suite and alone writes the marker. A PHASE under `**Verification tier:**
# impact` runs each HEAVY §Verification line in its SELECTED form: the test
# files its diff maps to, plus the invariants, plus a seeded sample of the rest.
# Every other line runs as written, and so does a heavy line whose diff touches
# a file in its scope that no test file names (`unmapped` — never a guess).
#
# Which lines are heavy is measured, not felt: p8-gate.json (phase 8, 6,443 s
# wall at dd8113d0) — server-suite 1,889 s, engine-parity 1,761 s, bash-engine
# 1,157 s, e2e 426 s, client-suite 128 s. Every other stage is under 30 s and is
# not worth a selection.
#
# Sourced by bash; read by viewer/server/runner/verify-select.ts, which
# verify-select.test.ts holds to this file (the drift test sources it and
# compares). Bash 3.2: plain strings, no arrays.

# How many test files the seeded sample adds to a selected line. The seed is the
# phase's boarding sha, so the baseline and the verdict draw the same sample, and
# two phases draw different ones.
VERIFY_SELECT_SAMPLE=3

# The node files every selected node line runs whatever the diff: the
# invariants a phase must never break unseen (CLAUDE.md's table — the operator's
# state, the engine's parity, the protocol).
VERIFY_SELECT_INVARIANTS='viewer/test/state-isolation.test.ts viewer/test/engine-parity.test.ts viewer/test/invariants.test.ts'

# One row per heavy line, TAB-separated:
#   id <TAB> the line (an ERE over the FOLDED command, whole) <TAB> kind <TAB> scope
# kind  — bats: run-tests.sh over RUN_TESTS_ONLY · node: node --test over files ·
#         vitest: `vitest related` over the changed sources · playwright: --only-changed
# scope — the path prefixes whose changes the line's tests read; a changed file
#         outside every prefix is not this line's to select for.
VERIFY_SELECT_ROWS='bats	^bash tests/run-tests\.sh$	bats	scripts/ tests/
node	^node --test( --[a-z-]+(=[0-9]+)?)* "?viewer/test/\*\.test\.ts"?$	node	viewer/server/ viewer/shared/ viewer/test/
npm-test	^npm --prefix viewer (run )?test$	node	viewer/server/ viewer/shared/ viewer/test/
client	^npm --prefix viewer run test:client$	vitest	viewer/client/ viewer/shared/
e2e	^npm --prefix viewer run test:e2e:dist$	playwright	viewer/'
